# ── 511.org Transit ──
# Key verifiziert (2026-08-14): operators/stops/StopMonitoring → 200, aber
# VehicleMonitoring (echte Echtzeit-Fahrzeugpositionen) → 401 (Premium-Tier).
# stops/operators sind statische Register (decline). Antwort ist gzip
# (Content-Encoding: gzip) — fetch_raw bräuchte --compressed. Regional (SF Bay).

decline registry-premium-gzip
url https://api.511.org/transit/stops?operator_id=SF&api_key={TRANSIT511_KEY}&format=json
note Free tier: stops/operators = static registries (Force Gate decline); VehicleMonitoring (real-time positions) = 401 premium; response gzip-compressed (parser has no --compressed). Regional SF Bay only.

# ── GBIF organism occurrences ──
# Presence catalog: occurrence records carry position + metadata, no physical
# field measurement. elevation/depth are position coordinates (sparse, ~1/300
# records); individualCount is a dropped count (borderline population density).

decline presence-catalog
url https://api.gbif.org/v1/occurrence/search?limit=300&hasCoordinate=true
note Presence/observation catalog — no surviving physical field. elevation is position data (geopotential height, sparse ~1/300); individualCount is a dropped count (borderline, per spec §3.2/§11). Position-only oscillators are dropped (§3.9).

